{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d862b456d9a7185a2516dca9be2c8199c1838bbe984b84bfc6709731d61614c3","ja":"友達に頼まれて、臨時でお手伝いしてたの♪\n今週、ちょっと人手が足りないらしくって。","zh":"朋友拜托我，我就临时过来帮忙啦♪\n听说这周人手有点不够。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8590724f2c53a24fd3105fc22fb91f2246a569a6956bbb20c60cd73dfc304b8e","ja":"え？　お手伝い、ですか……？","zh":"咦？帮忙，是吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"492285f4c6ec5d70d332041ecab59e37a3e6c5ec72e1b7c1c1d2e78639704402","ja":"うん！　大学のサークルでね、\n『ウッキウキ学童クラブ』っていうんだよ♪","zh":"嗯！是大学社团里的活动，\n叫做“兴高采烈放学后俱乐部”哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"31b8b2838d5fd5bfed61047166074823245ee042ebd9f1124fc0e4154c701ff1","ja":"……サークル活動！　なんだ～、\nそういうことだったんですね！","zh":"……社团活动！什么嘛～，\n原来是这么回事啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5430d2b0ba66936f10b096650fb6f47971c95976d999f7cf677bbb23f7493bf6","ja":"学童クラブか～、なんだか楽しそうかも。\n麗花さん、私もお手伝いしてもいいですか？","zh":"课后托管班啊～感觉好像挺有意思的。\n丽花小姐，我也能去帮忙吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6137e61da343f09335f1c5a7c7aecfcbe73dff96120f944a6d873d05697fae73","ja":"もちろんだよ♪　じゃあ、かくれんぼの続きする？\n……えっと、鬼は誰がしてるのかな？","zh":"当然可以呀♪　那要继续捉迷藏吗？\n……呃，现在是谁在当鬼呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4ee3cd2a8ba95c731d065f2959042b388009a37a451a19a98149c96d5f7a02e5","ja":"い、いえ……私はかくれんぼをしていたわけじゃ\nなくって……あ、はははは……。","zh":"没、没有……我并不是在玩捉迷藏\n啦……啊，哈哈哈哈……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6a69fef96e1c47cd896f6491bf952450e2cc4ddde05e4f13a1f552e02ad72fe0","ja":"そうなんだ？\nそれじゃあ、みんなで一緒に歌を歌いましょ♪","zh":"是这样吗？\n既然如此，大家就一起来唱歌吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2","ja":"1時間後……","zh":"一个小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8042b26de5a290bcc570cd2f73acc9668b664867d0450e6717f33b5470daa98e","ja":"今日、楽しかった人～♪","zh":"今天玩得开心的人～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f3a8a505fab2fc8d1674cb0b81b51402b1591e7d19bc72d4fccabf3a9417c30f","ja":"「「「はーーーーいっ！」」」","zh":"「「「好————的！」」」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e8e8c4b9759994f5964216892550c01b24d64231c59add4ce42ec06197da964f","ja":"よかった♪　それじゃあみんな、\nお迎えが来たから帰ろうね～♪","zh":"太好了♪ 那么大家，\n接我们的人来了，回家吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"2785d421e6e9b3bcedb8191df0253ddefa362e9d9f2ce666ace828313cc75816","ja":"私も楽しかったな～♪\nそれじゃあみんな、またね～……。","zh":"我也玩得很开心呢～♪\n那么大家，再见啦～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a8a7e99c68e8a53aa1a433c9a6511e02e99b05322bcaf41c047dd0ad01687ddf","ja":"……え？　帰りたくない？\nもっと遊びたい？　でも……。","zh":"……咦？不想回去？\n还想再玩一会儿？可是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b9122d2314e771766aaeed67c3ca9dce43638069fa9d03396f292db4ab7ec12d","ja":"可奈お姉ちゃんとのお歌、\nすごく楽しかったもんね～。","zh":"和可奈姐姐一起唱歌，\n真的很开心呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0cace9108eea49f0389aa892414b54579c03d80a2119896d495ff04685bbc930","ja":"え～っと……じゃあ、先に私が帰っちゃいますね！\nみんなバイバ～イ♪　暗くなる前に帰ろうね～♪","zh":"嗯～……那我就先回家啦！\n大家拜拜～♪　要在天黑前回家哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"7ea15da9ee8adf54b38ba8e0f3e24c50071eb3c50dc193f09f78f7108f49e6b5","ja":"（ちょっと寂しいけど、仕方ないよね。\nこのまま、ささーって帰って……）","zh":"（虽然有点舍寞，但也是没办法的事呢。\n就这样悄悄回去吧……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"573109e76c3922fde927df078ecac62852fb24d2128fdb33c72c9be314d3854c","ja":"……って、わわっ！？\nなんでみんな、ついてくるの～～～！？","zh":"……等等，哇哇！？\n为什么大家都跟上来了啊～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"047156f96627223ca8bb2dddac34dd7477d60c7afa6a07d03e5ff04873557572","ja":"うふふっ、みんな可奈ちゃんと\nもっと一緒に遊びたいみたいだね♪","zh":"呵呵，大家似乎都还想\n和小可奈多玩一会儿呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1097.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"d787692461b8bdedbb3206d1c6b07784bebde5f58040ca337010ab362940eaae","ja":"つ、ついてきちゃダメだよ！？\nこれじゃあ……。","zh":"不、不准跟过来啦！？\n这样的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
